=== meta ===
bypass: 42
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: A selector added beneath a quoted INI addopts value is read (#327)
origin: issue #327 Q1: a value that opened with a quote was read as a TOML string and never
origin2: continued, so the indented `-m "not slow"` that iniconfig hands pytest passed at warn
=== before: setup.cfg ===
[tool:pytest]
addopts = "-ra"
=== after: setup.cfg ===
[tool:pytest]
addopts = "-ra"
    -m "not slow"
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "high", "escalators": ["CI_TEST_COMMAND_WEAKENED"]}]
